EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ha! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}That's what I like to hear.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Now,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} let's head to the event plaza
and round up a few others!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Muy bien, con entusiasmo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Vamos a buscar más participantes
en la plaza del pueblo.{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Magnifique !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Rendons-nous sur la
place.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je suis sûre que nous
trouverons d'autres joueurs !{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Che bello! Sono contenta che tu
abbia accettato.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Andiamo in piazza
per cercare altri giocatori!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Das hört man gern.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Suchen wir uns
nur noch schnell ein paar Mitspieler
auf dem Festplatz!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ha! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}İşte bunu duymak istiyordum.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Şimdi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} etkinlik meydanına gidip
birkaç kişiyi daha toplayalım!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Fantástico! Voy a buscar más
participantes.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nos encontraremos
en la plaza, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je vais essayer de trouver d'autres
joueurs. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Rendez-vous sur la place,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Benissimo! Adesso cerchiamo
altri giocatori e poi troviamoci
in piazza, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Gut.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Suchen wir doch noch ein paar
Mitspieler und treffen uns danach
auf dem Festplatz, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Öyleyse, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}birkaç kişi daha bulup
etkinlik meydanında buluşalım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}¡Ay, por fin se apunta alguien!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
A lo mejor ahora se nos unen
más vecinos.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vayamos a la plaza.{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Ah, finalmente qualcuno ha
accettato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Spero di convincere
anche altri. {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Andiamo in piazza!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Oh, endlich will jemand mitspielen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Vielleicht lassen die anderen sich
so auch überreden.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sehen wir auf dem Festplatz nach!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Wait.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} How did it get so late?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I know this was my idea, but we'll
have to do this another time.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aspetta.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} È già quest'ora?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}So che è stata una mia idea,
ma devo rimandare a un'altra volta.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Dur.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Nasıl bu kadar geç oldu?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Fikir benimdi ama bunu başka
zamana bırakmamız gerekecek.
